repository-code: "https://github.com/no-way-labs/minimum-state-product"
abstract: >-
  Companion artifact for "Minimum state product for self-stabilizing
  token rings: exact values for n ≤ 8, phase transition at n = 9, and a
  landscape of attempted proofs." Contains the paper source, a Lean 4 /
  Mathlib formalization, an independent Python verifier, the full
  exploratory research record (~1,900 probes, ~584k LoC), and the
  research memos documenting attempted lower-bound approaches.
